# 国内域名 / 应用补全
# Maintainer: LouieLumi
# Organized: 2026-09-17
# Updated: 2026-10-19
# Rules: 20
# Policy-free Surge RULE-SET; edit this file directly on GitHub.
# Use the order in Surge-Rules.conf. Sources and changes: docs/SOURCES.md, docs/import-report.json.
# Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Blankwonder/surge-list/master/cn.list
# Upstream: Blankwonder/surge-list; no license declaration found in upstream.
# Source attribution does not add a new license; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

DOMAIN-KEYWORD,.tmall.
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,alicdn
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,alipay
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,aliyun
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,baidu
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,taobao
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cn
IP-CIDR,198.11.136.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,198.11.188.0/25,no-resolve
USER-AGENT,%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E6%B7%98%E5%AE%9D*
USER-AGENT,MApi*
USER-AGENT,MicroMessenger Client
USER-AGENT,WeChat*

# DeepSeek、Kimi / Moonshot、Qwen / 千问：国内服务直连，不进入「👾 人工智能」。
# 只补非 .cn 主域。moonshot.cn 等 .cn 主机已由上面的 DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cn 覆盖，
# 再写子域会造成文件内重复，校验会拒绝。
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepseek.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kimi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kimi.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,moonshot.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qwen.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qwenlm.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qianwen.com
